  "method": [
    "归一化条件",
    "定积分",
    "偶函数对称性"
  ],
  "solution_steps": [
    "利用归一化条件求k",
    "计算定积分",
    "求所要求的概率"
  ],
  "math_structure": {
    "type": "pdf_normalization",
    "template": "$\\int_{-\\infty}^{\\infty} f(x)dx = 1$ 确定参数，然后计算概率积分",
    "variable_count": 3
  },
  "difficulty": 3,
  "answer": [
    {
      "label": "求常数k和概率",
      "steps": [
        "由归一化条件：$\\int_{-\\infty}^{\\infty} f(x) dx = 1$",
        "$\\int_{-1}^{1} k(1-x^4) dx = 1$",
        "$k \\left[ x - \\frac{x^5}{5} \\right]_{-1}^{1} = 1$",
        "$k \\left[ \\left(1 - \\frac{1}{5}\\right) - \\left(-1 + \\frac{1}{5}\\right) \\right] = 1$",
        "$k \\left[ \\frac{4}{5} - \\left(-\\frac{4}{5}\\right) \\right] = 1$",
        "$k \\cdot \\frac{8}{5} = 1$，得 $k = \\frac{5}{8}$",
        "计算概率：$P\\left(-\\frac{1}{2} \\leq X \\leq \\frac{3}{2}\\right)$",
        "由于 $f(x) = 0$ 当 $|x| > 1$，所以 $P\\left(-\\frac{1}{2} \\leq X \\leq \\frac{3}{2}\\right) = P\\left(-\\frac{1}{2} \\leq X \\leq 1\\right)$",
        "$P\\left(-\\frac{1}{2} \\leq X \\leq 1\\right) = \\int_{-1/2}^{1} \\frac{5}{8}(1-x^4) dx$",
        "$= \\frac{5}{8} \\left[ x - \\frac{x^5}{5} \\right]_{-1/2}^{1}$",
        "$= \\frac{5}{8} \\left[ \\left(1 - \\frac{1}{5}\\right) - \\left(-\\frac{1}{2} - \\frac{(-1/2)^5}{5}\\right) \\right]$",
        "$= \\frac{5}{8} \\left[ \\frac{4}{5} - \\left(-\\frac{1}{2} + \\frac{1}{160}\\right) \\right]$",
        "$= \\frac{5}{8} \\left[ \\frac{4}{5} + \\frac{1}{2} - \\frac{1}{160} \\right]$",
        "$= \\frac{5}{8} \\left[ \\frac{64 + 40 - 1}{160} \\right] = \\frac{5}{8} \\cdot \\frac{103}{160} = \\frac{515}{1280} = \\frac{103}{256}$",
        "答案：$k = \\frac{5}{8}$，$P\\left(-\\frac{1}{2} \\leq X \\leq \\frac{3}{2}\\right) = \\frac{103}{256}$"
      ]
    }
  ],
